# Intent: stillness is the default (owner request 2026-10-20): the idle head movement starts OFF at boot, and the host sets it with self.robot.set_idle_motion {enabled}; the choice is saved in NVS (only on a change) and read at boot. The idle face expression no longer depends on the head motion modifier.
# Placement: unit (the head and the face run on the robot)
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/board/stackchan_display.{h,cc}, hal/board/hal_bridge.{h,cc}, hal/hal_mcp.cpp (MIT)
